        "body": "<p>Incoming - 611 (Contact undefined)<br>Message: Freedom Mobile Billing Alert: Your Auto Pay payment was unsuccessful. We will make one more attempt at Auto Pay within the next day. Please ensure your payment details are updated to avoid losing your Digital Discount. To update your payment details, please call us at 1-877-946-3184 or dial 611 from your Freedom phone, or log in to <a href=\"https://frdm.mobi/myacct\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://frdm.mobi/myacct</a>. (2024-10-03 12:00 p.m.)</p><hr> <p>You received this letter because you set up SMS forwarding from your phone via the \"SMS to phone / mail - auto redirect application\" (<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gawk.smsforwarder\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gawk.smsforwarder\" target=\"_blank\">https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gawk.smsforwarder)</a> <br>If you don't want to receive such emails anymore - <a href=\"https://sms.forwarder.api/email/unsubscribe?email=support@avicennaresearch.com&amp;token=nOAuDWvIbr9o8xeYDMmqxf3MmsjIANqE9jfZs9T8VJDCmPXCc8PQGyEPwCAk\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://sms.forwarder.api/email/unsubscribe?email=support@avicennaresearch.com&amp;token=nOAuDWvIbr9o8xeYDMmqxf3MmsjIANqE9jfZs9T8VJDCmPXCc8PQGyEPwCAk\" target=\"_blank\">Unsubscribe</a> </p>",
